{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — The reason the righteous know true knowledge, that there is an exalted Elohim beyond human knowledge, and He is wise of heart, knowing the universals which endure, and the particulars which change at every moment — yet HaShem does not know them, for they do not endure, and behold the doubt is in their hands, because they see the wicked who are at ease in their bodies and abundant in wealth, as in: 'Do for me this strength.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 73, :notes {0 "The verse citation at the end ('עשה לי את החיל הזה') could not be identified with certainty; it may refer to Judges 8:24 or a similar formula, or may be textually uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:34:15.133497966Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}